	"version"		"3"
	"revision"		"1"
	"title"		"Couch Launcher (keyboard)"
	"description"		"Maps the controller to the keys Couch Launcher understands, so input keeps working in Gaming Mode. D-pad and left stick: arrows. A: Enter. B: Escape. X: x (Tonight). Y: y (options). LB: q. RB: e. Start: s (Settings)."
